{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4yiTXpLGHDVFgMaT7Z","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The lock clicks. The door swings open slowly, hinges groaning with the weight of ages.*\n\n᚛ᚈᚆᚏᚑᚒᚌᚆ᚜\n\nYou step through.\n\nThe air changes. Cool stone breathes against your skin. Before you stretches a corridor lit by phosphorescence — the walls pulse faintly, as if the passage itself is alive and remembering something it once forgot.\n\nBehind you, I close.\n\nI do not open from this side."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":123,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}